Below is a well-structured user story for the `SILEmailSender` project implementation, adhering to proper standards (e.g., INVEST: Independent, Negotiable, Valuable, Estimable, Small, Testable). The user story includes a clear description, self-explanatory acceptance criteria, and a definition of done (DoD). The requirement to update the `SILCaseNotificationTable` with email status for each client, advisor, and client after each send attempt (success or failure) is incorporated into the acceptance criteria.

